+		/*
+		 * No struct page: a raw PFN of a VM_IO/VM_PFNMAP VMA, whether
+		 * seen by the up-front check (@pfnmap) or reported as -EEXIST
+		 * for a present PFN. Return -EFAULT so the caller reaches it
+		 * through vma->vm_ops->access().
